{"version":1,"text":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","id":"ar-legacy","title":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart","source":"synthetic:alder/quickstart-1.8","revision":1,"workspace_id":"0e75fb36-c33b-47dc-adbe-ae92434abba5"}